<p class="lead">Published in 1978 and edited by John Ferguson, <em>Seven Cities of Australia</em> brings together seven writers to profile Australia's major cities. Keith Dunstan contributed the Melbourne chapter, 'Melbourne: A Perfect Nineteenth-Century City'.</p>
